window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Equals, or enemies. </b><br> <br> I should never have trusted my sisters. But I did, and it's changed everything once again.<br> <br> All of their lies have boiled to the surface, and now I'm forced to see them for what they really are:<br> <br> Enemies.<br> <br> Life as I knew it has burned to ash and dissolved to nothing, but I can't back down now.<br> <br> It's not just my life at stake now—it's my mate's, my kingdom's, and our entire land's as well.</p> <p><b><i>This romantic fantasy was lightly inspired by Beauty and the Beast and is recommended for ages 17+ due to sexual content.</i></b></p>"; 
